{"op":"add","id":"s3","parent":"root","kind":"question","title":"How do regular contributions change it?","summary":"Monthly deposits, each starting its own compounding run","status":"open"}
{"op":"add","id":"s4","parent":"root","kind":"question","title":"What eats into compound growth?","summary":"Fees, inflation and withdrawals that shrink the 30-year result","status":"open"}
